# output_has:
#   - "{\"ev\":\"focus toggle\",\"frame_digest\":\"9c15dea4cd5524b0a223a75e81c135a27c0024c66c35ada60b33307a13b1c032\",\"input\":\"Focus\",\"ms\":0,\"ops\":null,\"seq\":4,"
#   - "frame {\"ev\":\"focus toggle\",\"frame_digest\":\"9c15dea4cd5524b0a223a75e81c135a27c0024c66c35ada60b33307a13b1c032\""
#   - "presented = 1"
#   - "replay ok:"
# provenance: targeted: HC-29, `host run frames sink` writes each emitted Frame as a line with its seq and digest, `host replay frames` re-derives the same frames from D alone, and a Presented confirmation is an input the program counts
